# Code owners for gahk_intern.
# GitHub auto-requests review from the owner(s) of every file a PR touches.
# Order matters: the LAST matching pattern wins, so keep the catch-all first
# and add more specific overrides below it.
#
# Owners can be users (@handle) or org teams (@G-A-Hagemanns-Kollegium/<team>).
# A team must exist and have write access to the repo, or GitHub ignores the line.

# Default owner: the Netværk team.
# NOTE: teams are referenced by SLUG (not display name), and GitHub silently ignores
# an invalid team. Confirm the slug in the team URL:
#   https://github.com/orgs/G-A-Hagemanns-Kollegium/teams/<slug>
# "Netværk" should slugify to "netvaerk" — fix the line below if the URL differs.
# The team must have write access to this repo, or the rule is ignored.
*                       @G-A-Hagemanns-Kollegium/netvaerk

